* QuarkTex ogles3.library: the PiStorm/Emu68 ogles3.library's shared library
* interface (ogles3 SDK 1.0, dispatch ABI 1, docs/phase10-ogles3.md), built
* from ogles2.library's sources. As there, LVO -30 returns the dispatch table
* and -36 is called by the SDK's OGLES3Close() before CloseLibrary.
##base _OGLES3Base
##bias 30
OGLES3GetDispatchTable()()
OGLES3PrivateLogFlush()()
##end
